d/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FteY3ucp0vibPTqAsetcgDxQo33UdbkpmKNRY8GKLONQm1hDMkXMKzqEribA0FaoIFtbHfTPeVg2akbEsMqcTicIYg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2020-03-12T02:28:20.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2NDk0MTM5MQ%3D%3D:2247483661:1","title":"Cobalt Strike 4.0 手册——献给渗透测试人员的先进威胁战术","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2NDk0MTM5MQ==&mid=2247483661&idx=1&sn=504ac2f7b2ab6d02c83e2dd5845bafa5&chksm=eaa5bb2dddd2323bb80f4050678f20610e31a5125d4654a7d09438df63f30a7abc49aafc903f&scene=126&sessionid=1795661892#rd","description":"Cobalt Strike 是一个为对手模拟和红队行动而设计的平台，主要用于执行有目地的攻击和模拟高级威胁者的后渗透行动。本章中会概述 Cobalt Strike 的功能集和相关的攻击流程。在本手册的剩余部分中会详细的讨论这些功能。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FteY3ucp0vibMEIXK6lbvRoydM5HSuXyCibTKwib0vZkEaGFQGylJsYNibS9ibgo0FOY2094akY27QS1IhFg30fqVbSg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2020-03-05T07:06:13.000Z"}]}